Codicons
========

The interface icons are Codicons 0.0.36 by Microsoft, the icon set of Visual
Studio Code, licensed under CC BY 4.0. They are embedded in the editor by
tools/make-icons.js from the mapping in tools/icons.json. The router, switch,
PC, JavaScript file and calculator icons are PTForge's own.

* Codicons: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons
* License: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/assets/codicons/LICENSE
* Icon mapping: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/tools/icons.json

To regenerate: npm pack @vscode/codicons@0.0.36, unpack it, then node https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/tools/make-icons.js package/src/icons.
